9. Can a Load Balancer work without EC2?
Yes. Load balancers can send traffic to:
EC2 instances
IP addresses
Containers
Lambda functions (ALB)
10. What are real-time use cases of Load Balancers?
High traffic websites
Microservices architecture
Auto scaling environments
High availability systems
Example:
 User → Load Balancer → Multiple EC2 servers
